8_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"大概几时还给我？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်အချိန်လောက် ပြန်ပေးမလဲ။","audio_file":"02.06.02-S018_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.02-S019","kind":"main","cn":"好，我收到了。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ လက်ခံရပြီ။","audio_file":"02.06.02-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.02-S019_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"收到了，谢啦。","meaning_my":"လက်ခံရပြီ၊ ကျေးဇူးနော်။","audio_file":"02.06.02-S019_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.02-S020","kind":"main","cn":"东西你收到了吗？","meaning_my":"ပစ္စည်း လက်ခံရပြီလား။","audio_file":"02.06.02-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.02-S020_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"收到了，谢谢。","meaning_my":"လက်ခံရပြီ၊ ကျေးဇူးပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.02-S020_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.02-S021","kind":"main","cn":"我还有东西没还给你。","meaning_my":"ပြန်မပေးရသေးတဲ့ ပစ္စည်း ရှိသေးတယ်။","audio_file":"02.06.02-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.02-S022","kind":"main","cn":"你检查一下。","meaning_my":"သေချာ စစ်ကြည့်ပါဦး။","audio_file":"02.06.02-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.02-S023","kind":"main","cn":"我放你桌上了。","meaning_my":"စားပွဲပေါ်မှာ တင်ထားခဲ့ပြီနော်။","audio_file":"02.06.02-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.02-S024","kind":"main","cn":"我放前台了。","meaning_my":"ဧည့်ကြိုကောင်တာမှာ ထားခဲ့တယ်။","audio_file":"02.06.02-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.02-S025","kind":"main","cn":"不小心弄坏了，我赔你。","meaning_my":"မတော်တဆ ပျက်သွားလို့ လျော်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"02.06.02-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.02-S025_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"没关系，看看能不能修好。","meaning_my":"ရပါတယ်၊ ပြန်ပြင်လို့ရမရ ကြည့်ကြတာပေါ့။","audio_file":"02.06.02-S025_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.02-S025_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"弄坏了我会赔的。","meaning_my":"ပျက်သွားတာကို လျော်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"02.06.02-S025_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.02-S026"