2.06.03-S002_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"把那瓶水拿给我。","meaning_my":"ဟိုရေဘူးကို ယူပေးပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S002_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S003","kind":"main","cn":"拿哪个？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်ဟာ ယူရမလဲ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"拿左边那个。","meaning_my":"ဘယ်ဘက်က ဟာကို ယူပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S004","kind":"main","cn":"拿左边那个。","meaning_my":"ဘယ်ဘက်က ဟာကို ယူပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S005","kind":"main","cn":"帮我拿最上面那个。","meaning_my":"အပေါ်ဆုံးက ဟာကို ယူပေးပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S006","kind":"main","cn":"这个太重了，帮我抬一下。","meaning_my":"ဒါ အရမ်းလေးတယ်၊ တစ်ချက်လောက် ကူမပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S006_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"帮我搭把手。","meaning_my":"တစ်ချက်လောက် ကူပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S006_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S007","kind":"main","cn":"帮我拿个袋子过来。","meaning_my":"အိတ်တစ်လုံး ယူလာပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S007_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"拿个袋子给我。","meaning_my":"အိတ်တစ်လုံး ယူပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S007_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S008","kind":"main","cn":"给你。","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ၊ ယူလိုက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S008_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"喏，给你。","meaning_my":"ရော့၊ ယူလိုက်။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S008_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S009","kind":"main","cn":"接一下。","meaning_my":"လှမ်းယူပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S009_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，递过来吧。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ လှမ်းပေးလိုက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S009_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S010","kind":"main","cn":"小心，有点烫。","meaning_my":"သတိထားနော်၊ နည်းနည်း ပူတယ်။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S010_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"小心点，烫。","meaning_my":"သတိထားနော်၊ ပူတယ်။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S010_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S011","kind":"main","cn":"小心，容易碎。","meaning_my":"သတိထားနော်၊ ကွဲလွယ်တယ်။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S012","kind":"main","cn":"可以，放哪儿？","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ ဘယ်မှာ ထားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S013","kind":"main","cn":"拿两个过来。","meaning_my":"နှစ်ခု ယူလာပေးပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S013_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"再拿两个来。","meaning_my":"နောက်ထပ် နှစ်ခု ယူလာပေးပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S013_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S014","kind":"main","cn":"这个帮我带过去。","meaning_my":"ဒါကို ဟိုဘက် သယ်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S014_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"帮我把这个送过去。","meaning_my":"ဒါကို ဟိုဘက် ပို့ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S014_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S015","kind":"main","cn":"麻烦递给小王。","meaning_my":"ရှောင်ဝမ်ကို လှမ်းပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S016","kind":"main","cn":"这个很重。","meaning_my":"ဒါ အရမ်းလေးတယ်။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S016_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"那我帮你拿吧。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို ကူကိုင်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S016_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S017","kind":"main","cn":"先拿一箱。","meaning_my":"အရင် တစ်သေတ္တာ ယူပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S018","kind":"main","cn":"拿稳点，别摔坏了。","meaning_my":"သေချာကိုင်ထားနော်၊ ပြုတ်ကျပြီး မပျက်စေနဲ့။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S018_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"拿稳了，别摔着。","meaning_my":"သေချာ ကိုင်ထားနော်၊ ပြုတ်မကျစေနဲ့။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S018_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S019","kind":"main","cn":"放到那边。","meaning_my":"ဟိုဘက်မှာ ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S019_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"放那边吧。","meaning_my":"ဟိုဘက်မှာ ထားလိုက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S019_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S020","kind":"main","cn":"先别搬这个。","meaning_my":"ဒါကို အခု မရွှေ့သေးနဲ့။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S021","kind":"main","cn":"拿完以后数一下。","meaning_my":"ယူပြီးရင် အရေအတွက် ရေတွက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S022","kind":"main","cn":"两只手拿稳。","meaning_my":"လက်နှစ်ဖက်နဲ့ မြဲမြဲကိုင်ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S022_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"双手拿好。","meaning_my":"လက်နှစ်ဖက်နဲ့ သေချာကိုင်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S022_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S023","kind":"main","cn":"一个个递过来。","meaning_my":"တစ်ခုချင်း လှမ်းပေးပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S024","kind":"main","cn":"往这边递。","meaning_my":"ဒီဘက်ကို လှမ်းပေးပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S025","kind":"main","cn":"我来帮你拿。","meaning_my":"ကူကိုင်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S026","kind":"main","cn":"再拿一个过来。","meaning_my":"နောက်တစ်ခု ယူလာပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S027","kind":"main","cn":"先放下吧。","meaning_my":"အရင် ချထားလိုက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S027.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S028","kind":"main","cn":"这个给你拿着。","meaning_my":"ဒါလေး ကိုင်ထားပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S028.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S029","kind":"main","cn":"轻拿轻放。","meaning_my":"ညင်ညင်သာသာ ကိုင်ပြီး ချပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S029.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S029_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"轻一点放。","meaning_my":"ညင်ညင်သာသာ ချပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S029_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S030","kind":"main","cn":"递慢一点。","meaning_my":"ဖြည်းဖြည်း လှမ်းပေးပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S030.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S031","kind":"main","cn":"拿好了吗？","meaning_my":"သေချာ ကိုင်ထားပြီလား။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S031.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.03-S031_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"拿好了，可以走了。","meaning_my":"မြဲမြဲ ကိုင်ထားပြီ၊ သွားလို့ရပြီ။","audio_file":"02.06.03-S031_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S001","kind":"main","cn":"这个放哪儿？","meaning_my":"ဒါ ဘယ်မှာ ထားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"放到柜子里吧。","meaning_my":"ဗီရိုထဲမှာ ထားလိုက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这个要放在哪里？","meaning_my":"ဒါကို ဘယ်နေရာမှာ ထားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S002","kind":"main","cn":"放回原位。","meaning_my":"နဂိုနေရာမှာ ပြန်ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S002_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"放回去。","meaning_my":"ပြန်ထားလိုက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S002_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S003","kind":"main","cn":"收起来。","meaning_my":"သိမ်းလိုက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S003_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"把东西收好。","meaning_my":"ပစ္စည်းတွေကို သေချာ သိမ်းလိုက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S003_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S004","kind":"main","cn":"这个放桌上可以吗？","meaning_my":"ဒါကို စားပွဲပေါ် တင်လို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S004_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"可以，放桌角吧。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ စားပွဲထောင့်မှာ ထားလိုက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S004_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S005","kind":"main","cn":"用完记得放回去。","meaning_my":"သုံးပြီးရင် ပြန်ထားဖို့ မမေ့နဲ့။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S005_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"用过后放回原处。","meaning_my":"သုံးပြီးရင် နဂိုနေရာမှာ ပြန်ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S005_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S006","kind":"main","cn":"别放这儿。","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ မထားနဲ့။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S006_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这里不能放。","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ ထားလို့ မရဘူး။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S006_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S007","kind":"main","cn":"放柜子里面。","meaning_my":"ဗီရိုထဲမှာ ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S008","kind":"main","cn":"先放在这儿吧。","meaning_my":"အခုတော့ ဒီမှာပဲ ထားလိုက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S009","kind":"main","cn":"放进去。","meaning_my":"အထဲ ထည့်လိုက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S009_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"放到里面去。","meaning_my":"အထဲကို ထည့်လိုက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S009_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S010","kind":"main","cn":"靠墙放。","meaning_my":"နံရံနားမှာ ကပ်ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S011","kind":"main","cn":"摆整齐。","meaning_my":"သပ်သပ်ရပ်ရပ် စီထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S011_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"摆放整齐。","meaning_my":"သပ်သပ်ရပ်ရပ် စီထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S011_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S012","kind":"main","cn":"不用，放一起就行。","meaning_my":"မလိုဘူး၊ အတူတူ ထားလိုက်ရုံပဲ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S013","kind":"main","cn":"这个应该放哪一层？","meaning_my":"ဒါကို စင်ရဲ့ ဘယ်အဆင့်မှာ ထားရမလဲ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S013_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"放第二层吧。","meaning_my":"ဒုတိယအဆင့်မှာ ထားလိုက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S013_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S014","kind":"main","cn":"上面那层还有空位。","meaning_my":"စင်အပေါ်တစ်ဆင့်မှာ နေရာလွတ် ရှိသေးတယ်။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S015","kind":"main","cn":"轻的放上面。","meaning_my":"ပေါ့တဲ့ဟာတွေကို အပေါ်မှာ ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S015_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"轻的摆上面。","meaning_my":"ပေါ့တဲ့ဟာတွေကို အပေါ်မှာ စီထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S015_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S016","kind":"main","cn":"箱子里放不下。","meaning_my":"သေတ္တာထဲ မဆံ့ဘူး။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S016_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"那换个大箱子吧。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို သေတ္တာကြီးတစ်လုံး ပြောင်းသုံးကြမယ်။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S016_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S017","kind":"main","cn":"这个先靠边放。","meaning_my":"ဒါကို ဘေးနားမှာ အရင် ချထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S018","kind":"main","cn":"把这些都收起来。","meaning_my":"ဒါတွေ အကုန် သိမ်းပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S018_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"把这些收好。","meaning_my":"ဒါတွေကို သေချာ သိမ်းထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S018_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S019","kind":"main","cn":"这个别和其他东西放一起。","meaning_my":"ဒါကို တခြားပစ္စည်းတွေနဲ့ အတူ မထားနဲ့။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S020","kind":"main","cn":"先放门边，别挡路。","meaning_my":"တံခါးဘေးမှာ အရင်ထားပါ၊ အသွားအလာ မပိတ်စေနဲ့။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S021","kind":"main","cn":"不用的时候放回这儿。","meaning_my":"မသုံးတဲ့အချိန် ဒီကို ပြန်ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S022","kind":"main","cn":"别乱放。","meaning_my":"တွေ့ရာနေရာမှာ မထားနဲ့။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S022_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"不要随便放。","meaning_my":"တွေ့ရာနေရာမှာ မထားနဲ့။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S022_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S023","kind":"main","cn":"一样的放一起。","meaning_my":"အမျိုးအစားတူတာတွေ အတူတူ ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S024","kind":"main","cn":"这个和那个分开放。","meaning_my":"ဒါနဲ့ ဟိုဟာကို သပ်သပ်စီ ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S024_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这两个分开放。","meaning_my":"ဒီနှစ်ခုကို သပ်သပ်စီ ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S024_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S025","kind":"main","cn":"重的放下面。","meaning_my":"လေးတဲ့ဟာတွေကို အောက်မှာ ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S025_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"重的放底下。","meaning_my":"လေးတဲ့ဟာတွေကို အောက်ဆုံးမှာ ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S025_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S026","kind":"main","cn":"别堆太高。","meaning_my":"အမြင့်ကြီး မပုံထားနဲ့။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S026_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"别叠得太高。","meaning_my":"အမြင့်ကြီး မထပ်ထားနဲ့။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S026_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S027","kind":"main","cn":"留点空位。","meaning_my":"နေရာလွတ် နည်းနည်း ချန်ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S027.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S028","kind":"main","cn":"都收好了吗？","meaning_my":"အားလုံး သိမ်းပြီးပြီလား။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S028.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S028_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"收好了，都在柜子里。","meaning_my":"သိမ်းပြီးပြီ၊ အားလုံး ဗီရိုထဲမှာ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S028_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S028_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"都整理好了吗？","meaning_my":"အားလုံး စနစ်တကျ သိမ်းပြီးပြီလား။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S028_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S029","kind":"main","cn":"这里放不下了。","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ ထပ်မဆံ့တော့ဘူး။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S029.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S029_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"那我换个地方放。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို တခြားနေရာ ပြောင်းထားမယ်။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S029_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S030","kind":"main","cn":"先把桌面收拾一下。","meaning_my":"စားပွဲပေါ်ကို အရင် နည်းနည်း ရှင်းလိုက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S030.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S031","kind":"main","cn":"放进抽屉里。","meaning_my":"အံဆွဲထဲ ထည့်ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S031.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.06.04-S032","kind":"main","cn":"易碎的单独放。","meaning_my":"ကွဲလွယ်တဲ့ပစ္စည်းတွေကို သပ်သပ် ထားပါ။","audio_file":"02.06.04-S032.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"}]}
